2. **Schema Integrity:** Verify all modified JSON-LD schema blocks using `python scripts/schema_validator.py`.
3. **Internal Linking Mesh:** Maintain directional conduits (Outer Pages -> Category Hubs -> Root Pillars) without exceeding 3 identical exact-match anchors.
